, onion, and tomatoes until softened."}, {"title": "Step 2", "description": "Add the ground beef and cook until browned."}, {"title": "Step 3", "description": "Stir in the carrots, green peas, and soy sauce."}, {"title": "Step 4", "description": "Simmer for 8–10 minutes until the vegetables are tender."}, {"title": "Step 5", "description": "Fry the eggs separately."}, {"title": "Step 6", "description": "Serve the beef giniling with steamed rice and a fried egg."}, {"title": "Step 7", "description": "Enjoy while hot."}]'::jsonb);
